  "description": "Located within the peaceful gated community of Selwo Hills, this spacious three-bedroom ground floor apartment is available for long-term rental from 1st August and offers comfortable living in one of Estepona's most desirable residential areas. Surrounded by beautifully maintained gardens and excellent communal facilities, the property is ideally situated just minutes from the beach, golf courses, supermarkets, international schools and all the amenities of Estepona's New Golden Mile.\n\nDesigned with generous living spaces and abundant natural light, the apartment is perfect for families, couples or professionals looking to enjoy the Costa del Sol lifestyle all year round.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed into a bright open-plan living and dining area with large sliding doors opening onto a spacious covered terrace overlooking the communal gardens and swimming pool. The terrace provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, relaxing or enjoying the Mediterranean climate throughout the year.\n\nThe independent kitchen is fully equipped with modern appliances and offers direct access to a practical utility area.\n\nThe property comprises three generously sized bedrooms and two bathrooms. The principal bedroom enjoys direct access to the terrace, while the remaining bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation with fitted wardrobes and plenty of natural light.\n\nResidents benefit from excellent communal facilities including beautifully landscaped gardens, a large swimming pool, a fully equipped gym and a sauna, all within a secure gated development. A padel club is also within walking distance, making this an ideal home for those with an active lifestyle.\n\nAvailable from 1st August, this apartment combines generous indoor and outdoor living spaces with an excellent location, making it an outstanding choice for those seeking a comfortable long-term home on the Costa del Sol.",
